  "title": "H-RIVALPARITY-1 part D F3 (2026-09-27): merged companies - on DISSOLVE each member's key gets a copy of the company's rival state; on MERGE the members' keys join the company key (active if any member was, completed / sent joined), both members get the company's state, no re-intro; ends dissolved; folds R1/R2: the HOST joining an existing company folds the company's stored rows into its native state (no re-intro, the old rows gone), the HOST leaving a company that carries on leaves the company its state; ends dissolved",
